                <p class="has-text-align-center"
                    style="margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">
                    <strong>Без крайности. Без тактики за сплашване. Само практически и реалистичен път напред.</strong>
                </p>
                <div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
                <figure class="wp-block-image alignfull size-full"><img decoding="async" width="970" height="600"
                        src="{{ 'gordura_IMAGEM3_BG.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" class="wp-image-207826"></figure>
                <div class="wp-block-group alignfull preview-opacity has-background has-global-padding is-content-justification-center is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-79d86c30 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"
                    style="background-color:#177964;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:80px;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0">
                    <div style="height:0px;width:0px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
                    <div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
                    <p class="has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size"
                        style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">
                        ⭐ <strong><strong>Какво съдържа този пакет от 3 книги бестселъри</strong></strong></p>
                    <div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
